<title>UK: London gold retreats ahead of Swiss sales plan.</title>
<headline>London gold retreats ahead of Swiss sales plan.</headline>
<byline>Brian Spoors</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold prices fell on Wednesday as a proposal from the ultra-conservative Swiss National Bank to sell gold from its reserves over 10 years came on top of dwindling confidence about the metal's recent rally, dealers said.</p>
<p>Gold fixed at $355.75 per ounce, down from $359.40 on Tuesday</p>
</text>
